===Projectile===
A gun projectile may be a simple, single-piece item like a bullet, a casing containing a payload like a shotshell or explosive shell, or complex projectile like a sub-caliber projectile and sabot.  The propellant may be air, an explosive solid, or an explosive liquid. Some variations like the [[Gyrojet]] and certain other types combine the projectile and propellant into a single item.{{citation needed|date=January 2022}}

